15222480,2025-08-12,Vehicle loan or lease,Loan,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"I am disputing an auto loan being reported by Regional Acceptance, account ending in XXXX. The loan paperwork lists me as the buyer ; however, I never purchased, took possession of, or made payments on this vehicle. The vehicle was not mine, and I did not benefit from this loan in any way. 

