15255085,2025-08-13,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Closing your account,Can't close your account,"I had this account for over fifteen years ( FNBO ). It had no balance, and they offered me a check with a lifetime interest rate of 6.99 %. I used it and transferred it instantly to another 0 % APR offer account that I had because I have an excellent credit score. On XX/XX/XXXX, I called the number on the back of my FNBO card to ask for the address. Somehow, the agent after verifying my identity sent me through some automated voice messages that were speaking really fast. He thanked me for subscribing to something that I didnt catch and said that I would be charged this amount unless I called the number so fast that I didnt have time to write it down. When the agent returned, I was very confused and asked him what I had signed up for. He said it was just an advertisement and promised that I wouldnt be charged for anything. 
